                        <d11p1:Value>Int</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>DisplayName</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>Gradient Spread Method</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>Tooltip</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>Sets what happens when the gradient starts or ends inside the bounds of the region that it fills:
- Pad uses the colors at the ends of the gradient to fill the rest of the region. This is the default method.
- Repeat repeats the gradient pattern continuously until the region is filled.
- Reflect reflects the gradient pattern continuously until the region is filled.</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>Category</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>Gradient</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>ValueProvider</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>Enum:Pad |0;Repeat |1;Reflect |2</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>Host</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>Kanzi.Shapes.Shape2D:context, Kanzi.Shapes.Shape3D:context, Kanzi.Shapes.GradientBrush:freq, Kanzi.Shapes.LinearGradientBrush:freq, Kanzi.Shapes.RadialGradientBrush:freq, Kanzi.Shapes.SweepGradientBrush:freq, Material:user</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>LegacyName</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>GradientBrush.GradientSpreadMethod</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                    </d6p1:fields>
                  </d6p1:EnginePropertyDefinition>
