                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>Tooltip</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>Sets a list of gradient color stops and enables gradient texture generation.
Use the CSS color stop syntax to define the color stops.
For example, to create red, green, and blue stops at equal distances:
rgba(255,0,0,1) 0%, rgba(0,128,0,1) 50%, rgba(0,0,255,1) 75%</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
