                        <d11p1:Key>EngineDefaultValue</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>0</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>DefaultValue</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>0</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>EngineType</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>Int</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>DisplayName</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>UV Mode</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>Tooltip</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>Sets how to generate the fill or stroke UVs:
- Content bounds relative creates axis-aligned UVs from 0 to 1 spanning the content bounds.
- Fill shape relative creates UVs spanning the fill geometry without taking stroke thickness into account (SVG compliant). This is the default.
- Absolute uses absolute path coordinates as UVs (SVG compliant).</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>Category</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>Paint</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>ValueProvider</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>Enum:Content bounds relative |0;Fill shape relative |1;Absolute |2</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>Host</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>Kanzi.Shapes.Shape2D:context, Kanzi.Shapes.Shape3D:context, Kanzi.Brush:context, Material:user</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>LegacyName</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>VectorShapesPaint.UVMode</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
