                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>EngineDefaultValue</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>0.000000</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>DefaultValue</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>0.000000</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>EngineType</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>Float</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>DisplayName</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>Corner Aspect Ratio</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>Tooltip</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>Sets the aspect ratio of the corners of the rectangle:
 - Corner Aspect Ratio = 0: X radius and Y radius are equal to Corner Radius.
 - Corner Aspect Ratio &gt; 0: Controls the X radius while keeping Y radius equal to Corner Radius. X radius is Corner Radius multiplied by (1 - Corner Aspect Ratio).
 - Corner Aspect Ratio &lt; 0: Controls the Y radius while keeping X radius equal to Corner Radius. Y radius is Corner Radius multiplied by (1 + Corner Aspect Ratio).</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>Editor</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>Slider</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>Host</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>Kanzi.Shapes.Rectangle2D:context,Kanzi.Shapes.Rectangle3D:context</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>LowerBound</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>-1</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>UpperBound</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>1</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>Step</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>0.01</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                    </d6p1:fields>
