                  <d6p1:EnginePropertyDefinition>
                    <d6p1:fields xmlns:d11p1="http://schemas.microsoft.com/2003/10/Serialization/Arrays">
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>Name</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>Shapes.ShapeConcept.StrokeDashPattern</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>EngineDefined</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>True</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>ExportToEngine</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>True</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>OwnerClass</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>Kanzi.Shapes.ShapeConcept</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>EngineType</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>String</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>DisplayName</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>Stroke Dash Pattern</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>Tooltip</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>Sets the dash pattern of the stroke. Enter a list of values separated by spaces or commas to set the lengths of the dashes and gaps.
For example:
- To set the lengths of the dashes and gaps to 5 pixels, enter 5.
- To set the length of the dashes to 10 pixels and gaps to 5 pixels, enter 10 5.</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>Host</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>Kanzi.Shapes.Shape2D:freq, Kanzi.Shapes.Shape3D:freq</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>LegacyName</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>VectorShape2D.StrokeDashPattern</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                    </d6p1:fields>
