              <d6p1:EngineMetaclass>
                <d6p1:Properties>
                  <d6p1:EnginePropertyDefinition>
                    <d6p1:fields xmlns:d11p1="http://schemas.microsoft.com/2003/10/Serialization/Arrays">
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>Name</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>Shapes.SVGImage3D.DepthOffsetStart</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>EngineDefined</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>True</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>ExportToEngine</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>True</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>OwnerClass</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>Kanzi.Shapes.SVGImage3D</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>EngineDefaultValue</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>0.000000,-3.000000</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>DefaultValue</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>0, -3</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>EngineType</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>Vector2</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>DisplayName</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>Depth Offset Start</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>Tooltip</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>Sets the polygon depth offset start value for the shapes created from the SVG image.
Use this property with the Depth Offset Step property.
The default value is (0, -3) when the Depth Rendering Mode property is set to Two Pass Rendering (default value), otherwise (0, 0).
</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>Editor</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>Vector2dSliderEditor.PolygonDepthOffsetEditor</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>Host</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>Kanzi.Shapes.SVGImage3D:context</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>LowerBound</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>-32, -32</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>UpperBound</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>32, 32</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>Step</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>0.1, 0.1</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                    </d6p1:fields>
                  </d6p1:EnginePropertyDefinition>
                  <d6p1:EnginePropertyDefinition>
                    <d6p1:fields xmlns:d11p1="http://schemas.microsoft.com/2003/10/Serialization/Arrays">
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>Name</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>Shapes.SVGImage3D.DepthOffsetStep</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>EngineDefined</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>True</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>ExportToEngine</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>True</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>OwnerClass</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>Kanzi.Shapes.SVGImage3D</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>EngineDefaultValue</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>0.000000,0.000000</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>DefaultValue</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>0, 0</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>EngineType</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>Vector2</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>DisplayName</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>Depth Offset Step</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>Tooltip</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>Sets the polygon depth offset step for the shapes created from the SVG image.

When you set the Depth Rendering Mode property to Depth Offset, Kanzi Shapes uses this property for fill and stroke based on an index derived from their render order within the SVG Image 3D node. If N is the last index, the final depth offset for the top most fill or stroke is Depth Offset Start + N * Depth Offset Step.

The default value is (0, 0) when the Depth Rendering Mode property is set to Two Pass Rendering (default value), otherwise (0, -3).
</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>Editor</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>Vector2dSliderEditor.PolygonDepthOffsetEditor</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>Host</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>Kanzi.Shapes.SVGImage3D:context</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>LowerBound</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>-32, -32</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>UpperBound</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>32, 32</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                      <d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                        <d11p1:Key>Step</d11p1:Key>
                        <d11p1:Value>0.1, 0.1</d11p1:Value>
                      </d11p1:KeyValueOfstringstring>
                    </d6p1:fields>
                  </d6p1:EnginePropertyDefinition>
                </d6p1:Properties>
